SupCalMoonLordReward: {
	// Rolename1: Brimstone Witch
	// Rolename2: Halibut
	// Line1: Hahaha...
	// Line2: So that's how far he's fallen.
	// Line3: Do you have any idea what the underground looks like right now?
	// Line4: ...So, why are you here this time?
	// Line5: A little toy for you. And a small commission.
	// Line6: A small crossbow. I need you to take it and kill that... *thing*... pathetically sucking up geothermal energy down there. And remember, you *must* use this crossbow.
	// Line7: If you succeed, our... 'partnership'... can continue.
}

SupCalDefeat: {
	// Rolename1: Brimstone Witch
	// Rolename2: Halibut & [Name]
	// Line1: To think you've already reached this level... Heh. I was outmatched.
	// Line2: But you are not the strongest. You may be good, but *he* is certainly no worse than you.
	// Line3: Yharim has already walked to the end of that path. He has reached the pinnacle of what a Terrarian can be. No one is stronger.
	// Line4: A pity you two cannot meet...
	// Line5: Your dimension is too low. You will never understand my state.
	// Line6: ...My dimension is too low?
	// Line7: (I've lived this long, and this is the first time anyone's told me my 'dimension' is low.)
	// Line8: I am the sole being 'birthed' by an era. Since I dared to cast off my Terrarian identity and declare myself a god, I am naturally omnipotent.
	// Line9: You say Yharim can 'weigh' me? You'd need to bring me a Xylos.
	// Line10: ......
}

SupCalPlayerDefeat: {
	// Rolename1: Brimstone Witch
	// Rolename2: Halibut
	// Line1: You shatter at a touch. Are you made of paper?
	// Line2: I thought I'd found a toy that would last a bit longer in the fire.
	// Line3: I overestimated you. Your current caliber... you aren't even worthy of being my warm-up.
	// Line4: Come back when you are strong enough to be worthy of my gaze.
	// Line5: Although... you do have *some* courage.
	// Line6: A mortal who dares to look me in the eye, let alone draw a blade... you are the first.
	// Line7: (Vanishes in a whirlwind of flame)
	// Line8: If I'd opened the ninth eye, consequences be damned... I should have had a chance. If it came to that...
	// Line9: Sigh...
}

SupCalVictory: {
	// Rolename1: Brimstone Witch
	// Rolename2: Halibut
	// Line1: What... How is this possible!
	// Line2: You... You defeated me?!
	// Line3: Impossible... This is absolutely impossible...
	// Line4: I have already surpassed the limits of a Terrarian...
	// Line5: ...It seems I truly underestimated you.
	// Line6: But this is not the end. I will return.
	// Line7: Next time... Next time, I will not be so careless!
	// Line8: ...She fled.
}

