SupCalDoGQuestReward: {
	// Rolename1: Brimstone Witch
	// Rolename2: Halibut
	// Line1: Cleanly done.
	// Line2: This blade... as satisfying as ever.
	// Line3: Back when I was still mortal, this is what I used to carve out my master's heart. It works well, doesn't it?
	// Line4: Take it.
	// Line5: Have you ever considered... what you would do if, next time, my commission was for you to kill ME?
	// Line6: Such a pity. You and he are fated never to meet. You two would have had... so much to talk about.
	// Line7: ......I really can't stand her.
}

