SupCalYharonQuestReward: {
	// Rolename1: Brimstone Witch
	// Rolename2: Halibut
	// Line1: Ah... it's finally over.
	// Line2: To me... that dragon... was one of the very few beings worthy of respect.
	// Line3: Knowing it would die, yet still choosing to stand its ground... Even if it's revived by the Auric Soul, the one that returns is merely a copy.
	// Line4: A pity. It excelled at obedience, while you excel at... hm, *surviving*?
	// Line5: Take this. Auric Ingot. Once called the 'Gold of Purgatory,' it is the limit of power a mortal can touch.
	// Line6: And now... it's my turn.
	// Line7: What kind of joke is this...?
}

