EternalBlazingNow: {
	// Rolename1: Halibut
	// Rolename2: ???Brimstone Witch???
	// Line1: Are you kidding me...
	// Line2: They've vanished... Is this fire... *sealing* the past?!
	// Line3: This witch... her power is truly no ordinary magic.
	// Line4: Was she holding back during the fight? No matter. Even against this kind of power, I'm confident I can kill you all over again.
	// Line5: I cannot die... but... this is close enough.
	// Line6: You have done well... Perhaps... you truly are the "Era's Chosen" he spoke of, the one worth waiting for.
	// Line7: So... I have one last thing to ask of you.
	// Line8: As long as a single ember of brimstone fire exists in this world's past or present, 'I' will not perish.
	// Line9: But my consciousness... in this endless sea of fire... it will eventually be worn down to nothing.
	// Line10: I can last 30 more years, at most.
	// Line11: ...So, you want *him* to replace you?
	// Line12: That's right. It is the only way.
	// Line13: When my consciousness fades completely, the entire world will be incinerated.
	// Line14: Besides... if you wish to end this era, a mortal vessel is far too fragile...
	// Line15: Absolutely not! Let him become a monster like you?! Over my dead body!
	// QuestionLine: ......
	// Choice1Text: (Stop Halibut)
	// Choice2Text: (Remain silent)
	// Choice1Line1: ...Is this your choice?
	// Choice1Line2: I understand...

	HelenEpilogue: {
		// EpilogueLine1: I'm waiting for an idiot.
		// EpilogueLine2: ...
		// EpilogueLine3: Welcome back...
	}

	// Rolename3: Brimstone Witch

	WitchFarewell: {
		// FarewellLine1: In this long life, I have seen countless dawns and endings.
		// FarewellLine2: Flames devour eras, but also illuminate new beginnings. I thought this time would be no exception.
		// FarewellLine3: I never expected to have a companion on this final road.
		// FarewellLine4: For me... an ending like this... is more than enough.
		// FarewellLine5: Your existence proves that this land has not truly withered.
		// FarewellLine6: I believe you will walk further than I ever did.
		// FarewellLine7: And I... I can finally rest.
		// FarewellLine8: Don't look back. There are more important things ahead of you.
		// FarewellLine9: Just... think of it as me finally reaching my own destination on this long journey.
		// FarewellLine10: And so... this is enough.
		// FarewellLine11: Go on, small fry.
	}

	// AchievementTitle: "[BE] Ending: The Eternally Burning Present"
	// AchievementTooltip: The past is consumed by fire; an aberrant body touches eternity.
}

